    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1083",
      "reading_order": 1168,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 726.2203800000001,
        "r": 367.97207999999995,
        "b": 713.1462493388431
      },
      "content": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1084",
      "reading_order": 1169,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 700.1427600000001,
        "r": 505.49463599999956,
        "b": 691.2473370491804
      },
      "content": "The recommended tool for this procedure is a medium size flat blade screwdriver."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1085",
      "reading_order": 1170,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 676.1431440000001,
        "r": 330.0960479999997,
        "b": 667.2477210491804
      },
      "content": "The replacement parts for this procedure are:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1086",
      "reading_order": 1171,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.999712,
        "t": 658.1434320000001,
        "r": 331.90976399999977,
        "b": 635.3473840327869
      },
      "content": "PWA, Power Supply Assembly, Cable, Power Supply/Battery"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1087",
      "reading_order": 1172,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.999712,
        "t": 630.12396,
        "r": 325.510464,
        "b": 621.3675280327868
      },
      "content": "Assembly, Cable, Power Supply/Driver"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1088",
      "reading_order": 1173,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 604.552656,
        "r": 539.9871120000007,
        "b": 571.3616763093622
      },
      "content": "CAUTION: Use  proper  ESD  grounding  techniques  when  handling  components. Wear an antistatic wrist strap and use an ESD-protected workstation. Store the PWA in an antistatic bag before placing it on any surface."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1089",
      "reading_order": 1174,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 556.145064,
        "r": 369.31753200000065,
        "b": 547.2496410491804
      },
      "content": "To replace the power supply PWA, proceed as follows:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1090",
      "reading_order": 1175,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039600000001,
        "t": 532.145448,
        "r": 444.2346599999992,
        "b": 523.2500250491803
      },
      "content": "Turn off the infuser and disconnect the device from AC power."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1091",
      "reading_order": 1176,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039600000001,
        "t": 516.665616,
        "r": 380.0474400000001,
        "b": 507.77019304918025
      },
      "content": "Remove the battery as described in Section 7.2.4 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1092",
      "reading_order": 1177,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039600000006,
        "t": 501.24554399999994,
        "r": 532.8079440000001,
        "b": 492.35012104918025
      },
      "content": "Separate the rear enclosure from the main chassis as described in Section 7.2.8 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1093",
      "reading_order": 1178,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039600000018,
        "t": 485.82547199999993,
        "r": 421.76987999999966,
        "b": 476.93004904918024
      },
      "content": "Disconnect the battery cable from the power supply PWA."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1094",
      "reading_order": 1179,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039600000018,
        "t": 470.34563999999995,
        "r": 415.5309360000007,
        "b": 461.45021704918025
      },
      "content": "Disconnect the driver cable from the power supply PWA."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1095",
      "reading_order": 1180,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039600000018,
        "t": 454.92556799999994,
        "r": 517.7603760000006,
        "b": 446.03014504918025
      },
      "content": "Remove the power supply PWA by sliding the board away from the CPU PWA."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1096",
      "reading_order": 1181,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039600000018,
        "t": 439.50549599999994,
        "r": 531.6824640000011,
        "b": 430.61007304918024
      },
      "content": "Install the replacement power supply PWA in the exact reverse order of removal."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1097",
      "reading_order": 1182,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 426.78,
        "r": 539.9640720000003,
        "b": 397.78752904918025
      },
      "content": " Note: Verify the replacement power supply PWA connects to the CPU PWA correctly to avoid misalignment."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1098",
      "reading_order": 1183,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.580264,
        "t": 386.70319199999994,
        "r": 540.0676559999988,
        "b": 366.34779304918027
      },
      "content": "Join  the  rear  enclosure  and  main  chassis  assembly  in  the  exact  reverse  order of separation."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1099",
      "reading_order": 1184,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.580264,
        "t": 359.82314399999996,
        "r": 420.4689720000002,
        "b": 350.92772104918026
      },
      "content": "Reinstall the battery and connect the device to AC power."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1100",
      "reading_order": 1185,
      "section": "POWER SUPPLY PWA REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 107.99986799999999,
        "t": 340.38321599999995,
        "r": 518.9474759999999,
        "b": 331.48779304918025
      },
      "content": "To verify successful power supply PWA replacement, perform the PVT in Section 5.2 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_1101",
      "reading_order": 1186,
      "section": "7.2.12.2 KEYPAD REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 107.99986799999994,
        "t": 310.38369599999993,
        "r": 280.12595400000004,
        "b": 285.34634933884297
      },
      "content": "7.2.12.2 KEYPAD REPLACEMENT",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1102",
      "reading_order": 1187,
      "section": "7.2.12.2 KEYPAD REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 270.36276,
        "r": 540.015,
        "b": 249.46752904918026
      },
      "content": "The recommended tools for this procedure are a #2 Phillips screwdriver, medium size flat blade screwdriver, and an X-acto knife."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1103",
      "reading_order": 1188,
      "section": "7.2.12.2 KEYPAD REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.00000000000003,
        "t": 234.363336,
        "r": 330.0960479999997,
        "b": 225.4679130491803
      },
      "content": "The replacement parts for this procedure are:"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "txt_1104",
      "reading_order": 1189,
      "section": "7.2.12.2 KEYPAD REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.99971200000003,
        "t": 216.36362399999996,
        "r": 397.05911999999955,
        "b": 151.62800803278685
      },
      "content": "Assembly, Keypad Gasket, Ground Spacer Screw, 4-24 x 1/4, Pan Head, Phillips Screw, 4-40 x 3/16, Hex Head, Slotted, with Washer"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_1105",
      "reading_order": 1190,
      "section": "7.2.12.2 KEYPAD REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 134.34402,
        "r": 418.3755119999996,
        "b": 125.44859704918031
      },
      "content": "To replace the keypad, see Figure 7-12, then proceed as follows:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1106",
      "reading_order": 1191,
      "section": "7.2.12.2 KEYPAD REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039600000006,
        "t": 110.34440399999994,
        "r": 444.2346599999993,
        "b": 101.44898104918025
      },
      "content": "Turn off the infuser and disconnect the device from AC power."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1107",
      "reading_order": 1192,
      "section": "7.2.12.2 KEYPAD REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039600000006,
        "t": 94.92433199999994,
        "r": 380.0474400000001,
        "b": 86.02890904918024
      },
      "content": "Remove the battery as described in Section 7.2.4 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1108",
      "reading_order": 1193,
      "section": "7.2.12.2 KEYPAD REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039600000006,
        "t": 79.50425999999993,
        "r": 539.9552399999997,
        "b": 59.148861049180255
      },
      "content": "Separate  the  front  enclosure,  rear  enclosure,  and  main  chassis  assembly as described in Section 7.2.8 ."
    }
  ]
}